  <h1>Ani<span class="surname">rudha Bose</span></h1>
  <p class="now" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ani-verb" id="ani-verb">{{ verbs[0] }}</span>…</p>

  <p>
    I'm a Senior Staff Engineer at <a href="https://brave.com">Brave</a>,
    working on web3 initiatives, mostly
    <a href="https://brave.com/wallet">Wallet</a>. I like building in public,
    and much of what I do is open source.
  </p>

  <p>
    My seam is where strategy becomes code, and I wear the PM hat as often as
    the engineering one. The work I'm proudest of isn't always clever — more
    often small, high-leverage, and aimed at a real person on the other side
    of the screen.
  </p>

  <p>
    I'm also interested in LLMs, finance, and business. I run an engineering
    and consulting practice through <a href="https://21mlabs.com">21M Labs</a>.
  </p>

  <p>
    I started my career in Paris and lived there for several years before
    moving to Bangalore, where I'm based now.
  </p>

